# Mintlify API Configuration
# To enable search and AI features during local development:
# 1. Get your API key from https://dashboard.mintlify.com/settings/api
# 2. Create a .env.local file (copy this file and rename it)
# 3. Add your actual API key below
# 4. Restart the dev server

NEXT_PUBLIC_MINTLIFY_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
